  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project to Integrate Small Producers into the Wine Production Chain</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Proyecto de Integracin de Pequeos Productores a la Cadena Vitivincola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejorar la rentabilidad y estabilidad de los ingresos de los pequeos productores primarios que participan en la cadena vitivincola. El propsito es lograr una mayor integracin de los participantes en la cadena vitivincola.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the profitability and the income sustainability of small primary producers within the grape  wine chain. Project&apos;s purpose is to attain a better and bigger integration of the actors within the grape and wine chain.</narrative>
  </description>
